# Leaks LeakSanitizer reports that are not leaks of Legato's, each matched as narrowly as the
# stacks allow, with why.

# SDL's audio output, which mpv tries when there is no sound server (CI, Xvfb), before Legato's
# silent fallback: SDL keeps a few bytes per thread it ran on. Matched on SDL, not on libmpv, so an
# mpv handle Legato fails to destroy is still reported.
leak:libSDL2-2.0.so
